column31:
The total annual jurisdiction-wide electricity consumption data provided above is the amount of electricity generated and consumed in Lagos. Estimate was done using year 2019 data as contained in the Power Sector Report:
Energy Generated and Sent Out
and Consumed and Load Allocation for year 2019. See link below;
https://www.nigerianstat.gov.ng/pdfuploads/Power_Generation_-_2019.pdf

On sources of generation, there are activities around renewable energy and biomass but it is significantly low below 1%. National data was used in this case, see link to data below;

https://www.statista.com/statistics/1237541/nigeria-distribution-of-electricity-production-by-source/
